{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_54_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"一、二十有五年，春，陳侯使女叔來聘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"其不名何也？天子之命大夫也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，癸丑，衞侯朔卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"三、六月，辛未，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"言日言朔，食正朔也。鼓，用牲於社。鼓，禮也。用牲，非禮也。天子救日，置五麾，陳五兵五鼓，諸侯置三麾，陳三鼓三兵。大夫繫門，士繫柝。言充其陽也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"四、伯姬歸於杞。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"其不言逆何也？逆之道微，無足道焉爾。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"五、秋，大水。鼓、用牲於社、於門。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"高下有水災曰大水。既戒鼓而駭眾，用牲可以已矣。救日以鼓兵，救水以鼓眾。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_54_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_54","textTraditional":"六、冬，公子友如陳。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}